{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"1CO","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"哥林多前書","commonName":"哥林多前書","title":"哥林多前書","order":46,"numberOfChapters":16,"sha256":"0bb2df52ecc035daf061ff19f8f15532627b064d54d80c5599126c0ead143f8d","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/1CO/1.json","lastChapterNumber":16,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/1CO/16.json","totalNumberOfVerses":437},"chapter":{"number":13,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["我若能說萬人的方言，並天使的話語，卻沒有愛，我就成了鳴的鑼，響的鈸一般。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["我若有先知講道之能，也明白各樣的奧祕，各樣的知識，而且有全備的信，叫我能夠移山，卻沒有愛，我就算不得甚麼。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["我若將所有的賙濟窮人，又捨己身叫人焚燒，卻沒有愛，仍然與我無益。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["愛是恆久忍耐，又有恩慈；愛是不嫉妒；愛是不自誇，不張狂，"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["不做害羞的事，不求自己的益處，不輕易發怒，不計算人的惡，"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["不喜歡不義，只喜歡真理；"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["凡事包容，凡事相信，凡事盼望，凡事忍耐。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["愛是永不止息。先知講道之能終必歸於無有；說方言之能終必停止；知識也終必歸於無有。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["我們現在所知道的有限，先知所講的也有限，"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["等那完全的來到，這有限的必歸於無有了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["我作孩子的時候，話語像孩子，心思像孩子，意念像孩子，既成了人，就把孩子的事丟棄了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["我們如今彷彿對着鏡子觀看，模糊不清",{"noteId":7},"，到那時就要面對面了。我如今所知道的有限，到那時就全知道，如同主知道我一樣。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["如今常存的有信，有望，有愛這三樣，其中最大的是愛。"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":7,"caller":"-","text":"原文是如同猜謎","reference":{"chapter":13,"verse":12}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/1CO/13.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/1CO/14.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/1CO/12.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":13}